ité</h2><p>Choisissez un mot de passe personnel et difficile à deviner.</p></header><label>Mot de passe actuel<div class="password-field"><input type="password" name="current_password" required><button type="button" data-password>Afficher</button></div></label><label>Nouveau mot de passe<div class="password-field"><input type="password" name="password" minlength="8" required><button type="button" data-password>Afficher</button></div><small>8 caractères minimum</small></label><label>Confirmer le nouveau mot de passe<input type="password" name="password_confirmation" minlength="8" required></label><footer><button class="site-btn green">Modifier mon mot de passe</button></footer></form></div></section><style>.profile-page{max-width:1080px;margin:auto;padding:45px 25px 80px}.profile-heading{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:25px}.profile-heading h1{font-size:30px;margin-bottom:6px}.profile-heading p:last-child{color:#71807c}.profile-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr .8fr;gap:20px}.profile-card{padding:0 25px 25px}.profile-card>header{padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e1e2dd}.profile-card header h2{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:4px}.profile-card header p{font-size:9px;color:#77827f;margin:0}.avatar-editor{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;padding:22px 0}.profile-photo{width:78px;height:78px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;background:#123f3a;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font:700 20px Manrope}.profile-photo img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.avatar-editor>small{color:#838d89}.profile-card .field-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}.profile-card label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700}.profile-card input{height:43px;border:1px solid #d7dad5;border-radius:5px;padding:0 12px}.profile-card input:disabled{background:#eef0ec;color:#76817e}.profile-card label small{font-weight:400;color:#838d89}.profile-card footer{display:flex;just